{"3591510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frutiger Space", "steam_appid": 3591510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/47a13ec2af3ca9207b621167e235ea0f.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space carries the spirit of 2000s social games, with the goal of creating a place where players can <strong>connect</strong>, form new <strong>friendships</strong>, and be part of a <strong>warm</strong> and <strong>inclusive</strong> <strong>community</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world where nature and futuristic architecture coexist in harmony:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mellifluous Meadows:</strong> Get thrown in the air by water geysers, platform on floating flowers, fly with giant bubbles, and catch a ride at the Train Station!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dorfin Bay:</strong> Feel the sunshine in this vibrant resort. Relax on the beach, play volleyball, take place in <i>Dorfin Races</i>, and swim through a tropical ocean to uncover its hidden riches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Central Park</strong>: your gateway to visiting the houses, spaces, and creative creations of fellow Webiies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plus, more areas are coming soon!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/d14994f60965910fa64d8e8585a23ee2.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Webiie</strong> is entirely yours to shape! Express your personality by mixing and matching different body parts, hair, motifs, and a huge variety of accessories for your head, body, arms, and legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/af72ad26458c95f18d3180d049a0fcac.avif?t=1786262788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras_big/af72ad26458c95f18d3180d049a0fcac.webp?t=1786262788 width=1560 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it goes much deeper than that: you have total control over <i>every single item</i>. Choose individual colors, add custom particle effects, and even select the specific material for each accessory, whether you want it to look like clear glass, glossy plastic, wood, and more! You can purchase new cosmetics with <strong>Orbs</strong>, which are obtained by completing tasks or simply exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/d8db09e418d1951a650d081bd5d7d2cd.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your building tools and design your very own &quot;<strong>Frutiger Space</strong>&quot;! Decorate your home, invite your friends over to hang out, or travel to other players' houses to get inspired by their creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/bdce78cbacaf9a2f94bacd7800142a4c.poster.avif?t=1786262788\" width=612 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/bdce78cbacaf9a2f94bacd7800142a4c.webm?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/bdce78cbacaf9a2f94bacd7800142a4c.mp4?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/c5003641a6ed32fd763f7c9635f6f638.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space is all about fun, creativity, and playing with friends! Jump into a wide range of activities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride and race with Dorfins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your dream home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in community hosted events on Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for four-leaf clovers and collect fruits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform and fly with giant bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play minigames and complete tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover easter eggs and a hidden story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/10e3c8ec39725fbe68c34157f10371b8.poster.avif?t=1786262788\" width=612 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/10e3c8ec39725fbe68c34157f10371b8.webm?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/10e3c8ec39725fbe68c34157f10371b8.mp4?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/aa03b06f59a3a4f9b3c490fec73701f0.webp?t=1786262788\" width=350 height=19 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/995f8b9b5fa5dc0855f6bcb0a4953a0e.webp?t=1786262788\" width=350 height=19 /></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/47a13ec2af3ca9207b621167e235ea0f.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space carries the spirit of 2000s social games, with the goal of creating a place where players can <strong>connect</strong>, form new <strong>friendships</strong>, and be part of a <strong>warm</strong> and <strong>inclusive</strong> <strong>community</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world where nature and futuristic architecture coexist in harmony:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mellifluous Meadows:</strong> Get thrown in the air by water geysers, platform on floating flowers, fly with giant bubbles, and catch a ride at the Train Station!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dorfin Bay:</strong> Feel the sunshine in this vibrant resort. Relax on the beach, play volleyball, take place in <i>Dorfin Races</i>, and swim through a tropical ocean to uncover its hidden riches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Central Park</strong>: your gateway to visiting the houses, spaces, and creative creations of fellow Webiies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Plus, more areas are coming soon!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/d14994f60965910fa64d8e8585a23ee2.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>Webiie</strong> is entirely yours to shape! Express your personality by mixing and matching different body parts, hair, motifs, and a huge variety of accessories for your head, body, arms, and legs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/af72ad26458c95f18d3180d049a0fcac.avif?t=1786262788\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras_big/af72ad26458c95f18d3180d049a0fcac.webp?t=1786262788 width=1560 height=718 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it goes much deeper than that: you have total control over <i>every single item</i>. Choose individual colors, add custom particle effects, and even select the specific material for each accessory, whether you want it to look like clear glass, glossy plastic, wood, and more! You can purchase new cosmetics with <strong>Orbs</strong>, which are obtained by completing tasks or simply exploring the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/d8db09e418d1951a650d081bd5d7d2cd.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your building tools and design your very own &quot;<strong>Frutiger Space</strong>&quot;! Decorate your home, invite your friends over to hang out, or travel to other players' houses to get inspired by their creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/bdce78cbacaf9a2f94bacd7800142a4c.poster.avif?t=1786262788\" width=612 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/bdce78cbacaf9a2f94bacd7800142a4c.webm?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/bdce78cbacaf9a2f94bacd7800142a4c.mp4?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/c5003641a6ed32fd763f7c9635f6f638.avif?t=1786262788\" width=364 height=96 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frutiger Space is all about fun, creativity, and playing with friends! Jump into a wide range of activities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride and race with Dorfins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your dream home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in community hosted events on Discord</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for four-leaf clovers and collect fruits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform and fly with giant bubbles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play minigames and complete tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover easter eggs and a hidden story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/10e3c8ec39725fbe68c34157f10371b8.poster.avif?t=1786262788\" width=612 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/10e3c8ec39725fbe68c34157f10371b8.webm?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/10e3c8ec39725fbe68c34157f10371b8.mp4?t=1786262788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/aa03b06f59a3a4f9b3c490fec73701f0.webp?t=1786262788\" width=350 height=19 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/extras/995f8b9b5fa5dc0855f6bcb0a4953a0e.webp?t=1786262788\" width=350 height=19 /></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Frutiger Space is a social multiplayer game that brings the optimistic vibes of the mid 2000s internet to life. Chill with friends, ride dolphins, design your dream house, and explore a world built on Frutiger Aero aesthetics!", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“While the era of Frutiger Aero may be long gone, Frutiger Space is hoping to recapture the magic of the early days of the Internet. Floating fish and all.”<br>VICE<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/f80c1dbdc5402d51981eb55c35a11fb6f80aa325/header.jpg?t=1786262788", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/74b019c36db40ba2b8f12eab80a7fe99856c46e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786262788", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591510/74b019c36db40ba2b8f12eab80a7fe99856c46e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786262788", "website": "https://www.studioginestra.com/frutiger-space", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD FX-4300 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030 or AMD Radeon R7 250 or Intel UHD 620 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Studio Ginestra"], "publishers": ["Studio Ginestra"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2